{title: O Rabba Koi To Bataaye}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar Anuradha Paudwal}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]O rabba ho,        [D#]O rabba koi to bataaye
[D#]O rabba koi to bataye pyar,        [G#]hota hai [D#]kya
Jaisa [G#]mujhe ho gaya sabko,        [A#]hota hai [D#]kya
[D#]O rabba koi to bataaye...        [D#]Yeh kaun aaya [G#]lage man bhaayaa
[G#]Zindgi ke paas mujhe [A#]kaun le [D#]aya,        [D#]O rabba koi to bataye chain
[D#]hota hai kya,        Jaisa [G#]mera kho gaya sabka
[A#]khota hai [D#]kya,        [D#]O rabba koi to bataaye...
[D#]Khyaalon ke baagon mein,        [G#]main jab khadi thi
[G#]Tabhi ek gul ne,        [A#]awaaz [D#]di thi
[D#]Kali si mehakne,        [G#]lagi tu kyon [D#]gori
[G#]Chhalakne lagi kyo ye,        [A#]gagar [D#]tori
[D#]Phul puchta raha mai sochti rahi,        [D#]Raat dhalti rahi Main Sochti Rahi
[D#]O rabba koi to bataaye roop,        [G#]hota hai [D#]kya
Jaisa [G#]mera khil gaya sabka,        [A#]khilta hai [D#]kya
[D#]O rabba koi to bataaye...        [D#]Hum to unche [G#]gagan me
[A#]udne [D#]lage,        Ek [G#]dooje se [D#]jaise [G#]judane lage
[D#]O rabba koi to bataye Meet,        [G#]hota hai [D#]kya
Jaisa [G#]mujhe mil gaya sabko,        [A#]milta hai [D#]kya
[D#]O rabba koi to bataaye...
